# Personal Portfolio

- Stack: Vite + Vue 3 (Composition API, <script setup>) + Tailwind CSS
- Animations: motion-v (hindi Framer Motion). Reusable values sa src/lib/motion.js
- Icons: simple-icons (inline SVG, currentColor)
- Theme: minimalist, dark blue + orange accent, may dark at light mode
- Fonts: Space Grotesk (headings), Inter (body), JetBrains Mono (maliliit na label lang), Instrument Serif italic (headline accent)
- Sections: Navbar, Hero, About, Skills, Projects, Experience, Contact, Footer
- Ang bawat section ay may `// label`, serif italic headline na may isang orange na salita, at mahinahong motion
- Data ng content ay nasa src/data/, hindi hardcoded sa components
- Igalang ang reduced motion, dark/light mode, at mobile (375px)
- Huwag galawin ang ibang sections maliban kung hiningi

## Git
- Diretso sa main, walang branches
- Commit message: isang linya, hindi lalampas sa 60 characters, walang body
- Format: feat:, fix:, refactor:, style:, docs:
- Huwag i-commit ang personal info (phone, address, ID numbers)